## Menu Studio: `EDMINBOOST_Menu_Studio`

Not a feature module — registered in `EDMINBOOST_Plugin::run()`.

- `is_active()` — plugin enabled + `menu_studio.enabled`.
- `get_settings()` — merged from `command_center.menu_studio`.
- `register_custom_items()` on `admin_menu` (5) — adds saved custom sidebar links.
- `apply_menu_changes()` on `admin_menu` (998) — reorders, hides, and nests submenus per saved config.
- `enqueue_styles()` — when active + `use_colors`, loads `edminboost-admin-menu.css` + inline color CSS vars.
- `filter_body_class()` — adds `edminboost-menu-studio-active` (+ `edminboost-menu-studio-colors` when colors on).
- Protected slugs (never hidden/reordered away): same as `EDMINBOOST_Admin_Menu::get_protected_slugs()`.

## Visual Theme: `EDMINBOOST_Theme`

Not a feature module — registered in `EDMINBOOST_Plugin::run()`. Separate from `look_skin` (behavior bundles).

- `get_defaults()`, `get_presets()`, `get_modes()`, `get_fonts()`, `sanitize()` — preset/mode/font/custom color settings.
- `is_active()` — plugin enabled + (plugin screen, live CC bar, or Layout Studio).
- `register_hooks()` — body/admin body classes, `edminboost-themes.css`, inline custom color overrides.
- Body classes: `edminboost-theme-{preset}`, `edminboost-theme-mode-{mode}`, `edminboost-theme-font-{font}`.
- No remote fonts — system font stacks only.

## Rules

- Read settings via `EDMINBOOST_Command_Center::get_settings()` — not raw `get_option()`.
- System presets (`system_client`, `system_ecommerce`, `system_developer`) are read-only; custom presets live in `command_center.presets`.
- `role_visibility` stores hidden slugs per role (inverted from visible checkboxes in UI).
- Mapper JS (`initMapper`) syncs visible canvas items to hidden inputs (`#edminboost-topbar-hidden-inputs`) before submit — includes `anchor` per item.
- Mapper UX: discovered rows are draggable to canvas; row click toggles checkbox (except handle/toggle areas); canvas and shell accept drops; `is-active` on discovered rows mirrors canvas membership for items **without** an anchor (anchored/custom links do not toggle discovered checkboxes). Plugin search: `#edminboost-plugin-search` filters discovered list by label.
- Menu Studio JS (`initMenuStudio`): mirrors mapper patterns for sidebar — `#edminboost-menu-studio-form`, `#edminboost-menu-canvas`, `#edminboost-menu-discovered-list`, `#edminboost-menu-hidden-inputs`, custom link fields `#edminboost-menu-custom-*`; marker `command_center[_menu_studio_save]` = `1`.
- Theme JS (`initTheme`): preset cards `.edminboost-theme-card`, mode/font selects, custom color pickers + text fields, live `#edminboost-theme-preview`.
- Custom admin link: `#edminboost-custom-link-path`, `#edminboost-custom-link-label`, `#edminboost-custom-link-anchor` — path may include `#fragment`; duplicate check uses slug+anchor.
- Item drawer: `#edminboost-item-anchor` edits the selected canvas item's anchor; `#edminboost-drawer-preview` (visible when interaction is `drawer`) triggers AJAX preview via `edminboostCcOpenDrawer`.
- Badge sources (`wc_orders`, `comments`, `forms_entries`, etc.) are local counters only — no remote API calls.
